1
00:00:00,689 --> 00:00:02,259
(Leonard:)How did she get you to do yoga?

2
00:00:02,858 --> 00:00:06,208
(Sheldon:)Well, to be honest,
I thought she said "Yoda."

3
00:00:09,431 --> 00:00:13,381
(Penny:)I'm helping him relax because,
unlike you, he supports me.

4
00:00:13,669 --> 00:00:15,949
(Leonard:)Oh, How many times
do I have to say it?

5
00:00:16,105 --> 00:00:18,445
(Leonard:)-I support you.
-Sheldon, take a break.

6
00:00:20,009 --> 00:00:21,679
(Sheldon:)Namaste.

7
00:00:23,179 --> 00:00:25,719
(Penny:)Okay, if you support me,
what was with that phone call?

8
00:00:25,881 --> 00:00:28,521
(Leonard:)Fine. I'm not sure
you should have quit.

9
00:00:28,684 --> 00:00:30,134
(Leonard:)But if you care so
much what I think,

10
00:00:30,286 --> 00:00:31,766
(Leonard:)why didn't you ask me
before you did it?

11
00:00:31,921 --> 00:00:33,261
(Penny:)Oh, so now I need
your permission?

12
00:00:33,422 --> 00:00:35,302
(Penny:)Would you have asked me
before you quit your job?

13
00:00:35,457 --> 00:00:37,957
(Leonard:)Yes. I thought we were
in the kind of relationship

14
00:00:38,127 --> 00:00:39,797
(Leonard:)where we make decisions together.

15
00:00:39,962 --> 00:00:41,372
(Leonard:)If I'm wrong,
then maybe we need to talk

16
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:43,130
(Leonard:)about the kind of relationship
we're actually in.

17
00:00:43,299 --> 00:00:44,639
(Penny:)Yeah, well, maybe we do.

18
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,640
(Sheldon:)I'm willing to if you guys are.

19
00:00:48,737 --> 00:00:49,807
(Leonard:)Can we please
have some privacy?

20
00:00:49,972 --> 00:00:51,312
(Leonard:)No.

21
00:00:51,473 --> 00:00:53,313
(Sheldon:)I'm as much a part of this
relationship as you two,

22
00:00:53,475 --> 00:00:56,115
(Sheldon:)and I think it's high time we
put all our cards on the table.

23
00:00:56,278 --> 00:00:58,418
Yeah. For example,
where is this going?

